# Subagent orchestration

- Parent agent coordinates, integrates, and commits — does not own large feature trees alone
- Spawn parallel Task subagents when write paths do not conflict
- Prefer project custom agents under `.cursor/agents/`:
  - `aeon-cleanup` — dead code + FormField/segment extract
  - `aeon-banking` — balance, parseAmount, PrivacyOverlay, forms/a11y
  - `aeon-security` — SecureLogger, redactPii, security tests
  - `aeon-tests` — unit / mock / RNTL / ViewModels
  - `aeon-detox` — e2e smoke only (`e2e/`)
  - `aeon-docs` — README / AGENTS / CODE_REVIEW
  - `aeon-verifier` — tsc/jest/lint + review skills after streams
- For full polish, load skill `aeon-submission-polish` and launch streams in parallel
- Each brief must include: paths to touch, AGENTS.md constraints, paths not to edit
- After a subagent finishes, keep the summary (APIs, files, test results) — do not re-read entire trees
- Before submission, run architecture / security / test-gap reviews in parallel (`aeon-architecture-review`, `aeon-security-pass`, `aeon-test-author`)
